/release

# Real broker export fixtures (own exports used for local/manual regression
# testing) — these contain genuine personal financial data (name, address,
# account number, real transactions/balances) and must never be committed.
# Committed tests use the sanitized copies in */fixtures/**/sanitized/
# instead — see tests/brokerImport/fixtures/revolut/README.md.
tests/brokerImport/fixtures/revolut/*.csv
tests/brokerImport/fixtures/revolut/*.pdf
tests/brokerImport/fixtures/revolut/*.json
!tests/brokerImport/fixtures/revolut/sanitized/
!tests/brokerImport/fixtures/revolut/sanitized/**
